class template for
each character type ([basic.fundamental]),
each standard integer type, and
any other types needed by the typedefs in the header ___'><cstdint>.
 For each such type integral-type, the specialization
atomic<integral-type> provides additional atomic operations appropriate to integral types.
 [Note 1: The specialization atomic<bool>
uses the primary template ([atomics.types.generic]).
